   venv; the chroma crossfade needs the `chroma_other` head registered (it degrades to a warning
   without it). `_switch_backbone`'s restore-on-failure path is only tested against a fake server.
4. M2 T15: record real responses and swap them in for the hand-made mock fixtures, so client/server
   shape drift fails a test. It has already happened once: the envelope vectors use `env`, and the
   TS test read `envelope`.

